WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.006 --> 00:00:01.985
SOLDIER
15 seconds to drop.

00:00:01.985 --> 00:00:03.295
BUCKY BARNES
What's our plan?

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.060
Great.

00:00:08.579 --> 00:00:09.982
[Grunting painfully]

00:00:10.006 --> 00:00:10.943
SAM WILSON
Oh ho ho!

00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:12.796
I have all of that on camera.

00:00:12.796 --> 00:00:14.071
BUCKY BARNES
Get out of my face, Sam.

00:00:14.071 --> 00:00:15.537
SAM WILSON
[Laughing]

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:17.434
POLITICIAN
Let me be clear.

00:00:18.855 --> 00:00:20.979
Our country is vulnerable.

00:00:22.806 --> 00:00:24.383
We need new heroes.

00:00:25.103 --> 00:00:26.391
SAM WILSON
Let's get to work.

00:00:30.252 --> 00:00:31.573
SAM WILSON
You went the wrong way!

00:00:34.017 --> 00:00:34.962
BUCKY BARNES
We're not a team.

00:00:34.962 --> 00:00:35.984
SAM WILSON
Nope.

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:38.798
BUCKY BARNES
We're partners.

00:00:41.939 --> 00:00:43.163
SAM WILSON
Co-workers.

00:00:46.001 --> 00:00:47.392
We look damn good though.

